  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "style": "JournalLabel",
      "text": "PROJECT REFLECTION JOURNAL"
    },
    {
      "style": "Title",
      "text": "A quieter pour"
    },
    {
      "style": "JournalSubtitle",
      "text": "A record of choices and the next question"
    },
    {
      "style": "JournalOpening",
      "text": "A project leaves a trail of small choices. Keep the useful ones close: what you noticed, what you made…"
    },
    {
      "style": "JournalContents",
      "text": "Begin with one project"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Refining the lip of a small ceramic pouring vessel. This record concerns a cool-water studio trial only."
    },
    {
      "style": "JournalMetadata",
      "text": "Maker Ari Venn / Project CER-01"
    },
    {
      "style": "JournalContents",
      "text": "Return to the work"
    },
    {
      "style": "JournalLink",
      "text": "Entry one / 2"
    },
    {
      "style": "JournalLink",
      "text": "Entry two / 3"
    },
    {
      "style": "JournalLink",
      "text": "The next test / 4"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Date each entry. Separate what you observed from what you inferred. Keep the next test small enough to…"
    },
    {
      "style": "JournalSource",
      "text": "Fictional maker and trial notes throughout. No trial was performed."
    },
    {
      "style": "JournalFolio",
      "text": "01"
    },
    {
      "style": "JournalLabel",
      "text": "ENTRY 01"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading1",
      "text": "A bead at the lip"
    },
    {
      "style": "JournalMetadata",
      "text": "2026-09-08 / E01 / CER-01"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "What happened and where is the record?"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Three of five cool-water pours ended without a trailing drop. Two left a bead on the underside of the…"
    },
    {
      "style": "JournalSource",
      "text": "C01 | Imagined studio note for the original lip"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "What might it mean and what will you change?"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Interpretation: The lip may be holding a little water after the vessel returns upright. This trial does…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Decision: Keep the handle and body unchanged; make one slightly sharper lip profile for the next…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "What remains uncertain?"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Does the sharper lip change the trailing drop under the same pour routine?"
    },
    {
      "style": "JournalLink",
      "text": "Back to the opening / 1"
    },
    {
      "style": "JournalFolio",
      "text": "02"
    },
    {
      "style": "JournalLabel",
      "text": "ENTRY 02"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading1",
      "text": "One change to compare"
    },
    {
      "style": "JournalMetadata",
      "text": "2026-09-10 / E02 / CER-01"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "What happened and where is the record?"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Four of five pours from the revised vessel ended without a trailing drop. One left a bead under the lip."
    },
    {
      "style": "JournalSource",
      "text": "C02 | Imagined studio note for the revised lip"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "What might it mean and what will you change?"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Interpretation: The revised profile looked more promising in this small trial. A different pour angle…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Decision: Retain both profiles for a controlled comparison before choosing a final lip."
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "What remains uncertain?"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Does either lip perform more consistently when fill, angle and pause are held steady?"
    },
    {
      "style": "JournalLink",
      "text": "Back to the opening / 1"
    },
    {
      "style": "JournalFolio",
      "text": "03"
    },
    {
      "style": "JournalLabel",
      "text": "THE NEXT TEST"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading1",
      "text": "Leave a question open"
    },
    {
      "style": "JournalMetadata",
      "text": "T01 / From E02 / Planned for 2026-09-12"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "The question to carry forward"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Does either lip perform more consistently when fill, angle and pause are held steady?"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "What you will do"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Use 100 mL of cool water per pour. Alternate profiles for ten pours each, using the same angle guide…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "What would support a decision"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Choose a profile only if it has at least eight clean returns out of ten and at least two more clean…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "When to stop or revise the plan"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Stop if a vessel is damaged or the angle guide moves. Record why; restart the comparison only after the…"
    },
    {
      "style": "JournalSource",
      "text": "Outcome: not recorded. This test is planned."
    },
    {
      "style": "JournalLink",
      "text": "Back to the opening / 1"
    },
    {
      "style": "JournalFolio",
      "text": "04"
    }
  ],
